 "summary": "A custom zombie sandbox including slow, fast, and crawling Zombies.",
 "description": "Project Outbreak aims to enhance the Zombie experience in Arma Reforger. It includes various Zombie archetypes (slow, fast, crawling), animations, and ways to customize Zombie health and damage.\n\n\nPlace them directly through Game Master or use ambient populations and directed waves to shape an entire scenario.\n\n\nSeveral attack and tackling animations come from Yummy Games, as well as sounds (https://www.fab.com/listings/f5e4fd19-febd-43b1-8799-b6c4c8f1f23b). Feral movement also uses Crawling Ghoul Anims (https://www.fab.com/listings/9e96b3f7-30ca-4221-a2eb-2bd46146b286) by RamsterZ.\n\nRequires Creature Melee AI. Original Project Outbreak content is released under the Arma Public License (APL). Incorporated assets remain under the Fab Standard License.\n\nFor questions, join the Discord Server: \nhttps://discord.gg/JumfhFujRF\n\nTItle Screenshot by redeye.vol2",
