 "changelog": "1.2.0\n- Fixed Zombie Permanent Kills with ACE Medical hit-zone mods. Headshots, explosions and fire can finish Zombies again, while ordinary body damage still only knocks them down. Servers without ACE are unchanged.\n- New setting: Placing Ignores AI Limit. Off by default. Turn it on to keep placing creatures by hand after Project Outbreak's active-AI budget is full. Ambience, directed spawning and reanimation keep their own budgets.\n- Fixed scenario-authored zombie rules being absent from published packages.\n- Bonus Zombie vocals",
